Description: Provides an R interface to the Python 'jsf' package for
    Jump-Switch-Flow simulation of compartmental reaction models. It supports
    model definition in R, simulation through 'reticulate', and structured
    outputs for inspection, summarisation, and plotting.License: MIT + file LICENSE
